  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile setups with avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion (config_019) achieve high validation accuracy (0.639). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder from resnet50 to imagenet_vit_l while maintaining the same RNA encoder (pca_n2000), aggregation (avgpool), and fusion (weighted). This clarifies whether the choice of image encoder significantly impacts performance, a critical design decision with potential for high impact. It balances exploitation of the current best setup with exploration of a more advanced image encoder."
